            </h3>
            <p>
              Your office renovation will be overseen by seasoned professionals with a proven track record of
              delivering exceptional results.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>
              <img class="or-check-img" src="/service/office-renovation/check-circle.svg" alt="" width="26" height="26" />
              Licensed &amp; Trusted
            </h3>
            <p>
              We are a fully licensed Dubai renovation company, ensuring compliance with all regulations and safety
              standards.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>
              <img class="or-check-img" src="/service/office-renovation/check-circle.svg" alt="" width="26" height="26" />
              Transparent Pricing
            </h3>
