            </p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>Interior Fit-Out</h3>
            <p>Create a modern and functional workspace with high-quality finishes and detailing.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>Furniture Selection and Installation</h3>
            <p>Source and install stylish and ergonomic furniture to enhance productivity and comfort.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>Technology Integration</h3>
